@startuml deployment
!include _style.puml
title 图5.1　部署图（LoongArch + 麒麟高级服务器版 V11）

node "运维管理员终端" as Client {
  artifact "浏览器\n(Chrome / firefox)" as Browser
}

node "麒麟高级服务器版 V11\n（LoongArch 架构）" as Server {
  artifact "Nginx / 静态资源\nVue3 前端 dist" as Web
  node "Python 3.11 运行时" as Py {
    artifact "FastAPI + Uvicorn\n应用服务（S 端）" as App
    artifact "MCP Server\n23 个 READONLY 工具" as MCP
    artifact "安全护栏 + 执行器\n（最小权限·沙箱）" as Guard
  }
  database "SQLite\n审计库 audit.db" as DB
  artifact "系统命令 / 内核接口\npsutil·lsof·ss·journalctl" as SysTools
}

cloud "DeepSeek 开放平台\n（OpenAI 兼容 API）" as DeepSeek

Browser --> Web : HTTPS（页面）
Browser --> App : HTTP/REST + SSE\n127.0.0.1 / 内网
App --> MCP : stdio / 进程内调用
App --> Guard : 命令必经裁决
App --> DB : 思维链落库
MCP --> SysTools : 只读采集
Guard --> SysTools : 放行后最小权限执行
App ..> DeepSeek : HTTPS（可离线切 mock）

note bottom of Server
  纯逻辑在 x86 开发完成；麒麟端仅做 LoongArch 适配与最终演示。
  默认仅监听 127.0.0.1；生产配 operator_token 鉴权受控动作。
end note
@enduml
